    "title": "OpenTable Lists 2 Massachusetts Restaurants Among the Most Romantic in US - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Michael Vyskocil ,\n17 hours ago Two Massachusetts dining spots have made their way onto OpenTable's 2026 Top 100 Romantic Restaurants in America list. Sorellina in Boston and Pellana Steakhouse in Peabody were selected from OpenTable reviews of restaurants across the Bay State. OpenTable's 2026 list draws on analysis of more than 9 million reviews and dining metrics collected between December 2024 and November 2025. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
